{"headword":"פָּקַח","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. open</strong> eyes and (once) ears <strong>(</strong>NH id., <em>open</em> (and remove) rubbish heap, sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> <em>look to, attend to;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">فَقَحَ</span> <em>blossom</em>, ii. <em>open eyes;</em> J.Aram <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּקַח</span> <em>open</em> eyes, etc.; Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܦܩܰܚ</span> <em>blossom</em><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 27:19\" href=\"/Job.27.19\">Jb 27:19</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּקַחְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 14:3\" href=\"/Job.14.3\">14:3</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּפְקַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:19\" href=\"/Genesis.21.19\">Gn 21:19</a> +; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶפְקַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 12:4\" href=\"/Zechariah.12.4\">Zc 12:4</a>; Imv. ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּקַח</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:17\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.17\">2 K 6:17</a> +, so <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:18\" href=\"/Daniel.9.18\">Dn 9:18</a> Qr (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">פקחה</span>); Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּקוֹחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.20\">Is 42:20</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִפְקֹחַ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.7\">7</a>; Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">פֹּקֵחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 146:8\" href=\"/Psalms.146.8\">ψ 146:8</a>; pass. fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּקֻחוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.19\">Je 32:19</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>open</em> eyes:"},{"senses":[{"definition":"one’s own <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:35\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.35\">2 K 4:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 27:19\" href=\"/Job.27.19\">Jb 27:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.13\">Pr 20:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.16\">2 K 19:16</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.17\">Is 37:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:18\" href=\"/Daniel.9.18\">Dn 9:18</a>; + <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.19\">Je 32:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 12:4\" href=\"/Zechariah.12.4\">Zc 12:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 14:3\" href=\"/Job.14.3\">Jb 14:3</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"eyes of others <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:19\" href=\"/Genesis.21.19\">Gn 21:19</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:17\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.17\">2 K 6:17</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:20\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.20\">20</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.7\">Is 42:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 146:8\" href=\"/Psalms.146.8\">ψ 146:8</a>;—for details v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, עַ֫יִן\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_עַ֫יִן\">עַיִן</a> <strong>1 j.</strong>"}],"num":"b."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>open</em> ears = hear <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.20\">Is 42:20</a> (without understanding; fig. of Isr.)."}],"num":"2."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 pl. consec. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנִפְקְחוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:5\" href=\"/Genesis.3.5\">Gn 3:5</a>; Impf. 3 fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּפָּקַחְנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.5\">Is 35:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:7\" href=\"/Genesis.3.7\">Gn 3:7</a>;—<em>be opened</em>, of eyes; fig., so as to know good and evil <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:5\" href=\"/Genesis.3.5\">Gn 3:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:7\" href=\"/Genesis.3.7\">7</a>; opp. blindness (fig.) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.5\">Is 35:5</a>."}],"form":"Niph."}]},"rid":"BDB08030","strong_numbers":["6491"],"next_hw":"פִּקֵּחַ","prev_hw":"פְּקוֹד","all_cited":true,"root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["7219"],"TWOT":["1803"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Dri